","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-9cffc7247859df87760f4371","text":"按既定的方向偏离井口垂线90度左右，钻达目的层并维持一定长度的特殊井。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":165.98610301092083,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":444.832418139095,"y1":470.8226268393567},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0011","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-abcc38d5d3f0ff4f4fb97e21","text":"水平井的主要优点是可以提高单井产量和采收率，延长开采周期，减少钻井过程中的排污量和占地面积等。"}],"text":"按既定的方向偏离井口垂线90度左右，钻达目的层并维持一定长度的特殊井。水平井的主要优点是可以提高单井产量和采收率，延长开采周期，减少钻井过程中的排污量和占地面积等。","unit":null},{"cells":[],"group":"G38","group_id":"block:block-p0092-0009","image_path":"/Users/choney/Desktop/ESG  Database/ESG_DATA_PLATFORM/ExtractESG/document_ir_extract/document_ir_output/ir-20261006T195007Z-2a5862660c87/artifacts/page-images/page-0092.png","label":"","locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":49.49585601831676,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":394.35143585589435,"y1":418.84220943883327},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0009","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"page":91,"support_segments":[{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":49.49585601831676,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":394.35143585589435,"y1":418.84220943883327},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0009","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-117f14234e9fe6b663000aa8","text":"采收率 > 由一次采油和（或）注水开发及强化采油最终可采出的储层中油或气的百分数。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":49.49585601831676,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":394.35143585589435,"y1":418.84220943883327},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0009","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-526838d6addc1772f9d4efed","text":"采收率 > 由一次采油和（或）注水开发及强化采油最终可采出的储层中油或气的百分数。一次采收率取决于油藏驱动类型以及储层的渗透率、储层非均质性、油和气的黏度以及开发技术政策等其他因素。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":49.49585601831676,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":394.35143585589435,"y1":418.84220943883327},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0009","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-9552d0ed4c08aabbd31b8bda","text":"一次采收率取决于油藏驱动类型以及储层的渗透率、储层非均质性、油和气的黏度以及开发技术政策等其他因素。"}],"text":"采收率 > 由一次采油和（或）注水开发及强化采油最终可采出的储层中油或气的百分数。一次采收率取决于油藏驱动类型以及储层的渗透率、储层非均质性、油和气的黏度以及开发技术政策等其他因素。"},{"cells":[],"group":"G46","group_id":"block:block-p0092-0017","image_path":"/Users/choney/Desktop/ESG  Database/ESG_DATA_PLATFORM/ExtractESG/document_ir_extract/document_ir_output/ir-20261006T195007Z-2a5862660c87/artifacts/page-images/page-0092.png","label":"","locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":165.48614486932166,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":586.2791308732117,"y1":626.2640673351528},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0017","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"page":91,"support_segments":[{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":165.48614486932166,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":586.2791308732117,"y1":626.2640673351528},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0017","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-12aa985d8925a169964ad000","text":"实质是能源高效利用、清洁能源开发和追求绿色GDP，核心是产业结构优化、低碳技术和相关制度体系创新，实现的基本途径是节能减排和发展清洁能源。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":165.48614486932166,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":586.2791308732117,"y1":626.2640673351528},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0017","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-d5eb2cd7ac54273f2acccf8f","text":"指以低能耗、低污染、低排放为特征的经济发展模式。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":165.48614486932166,"x1":526.4559231039145,"y0":586.2791308732117,"y1":626.2640673351528},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0017","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-fe1bb55fee2259d2ebf04284","text":"指以低能耗、低污染、低排放为特征的经济发展模式。实质是能源高效利用、清洁能源开发和追求绿色GDP，核心是产业结构优化、低碳技术和相关制度体系创新，实现的基本途径是节能减排和发展清洁能源。"}],"text":"指以低能耗、低污染、低排放为特征的经济发展模式。实质是能源高效利用、清洁能源开发和追求绿色GDP，核心是产业结构优化、低碳技术和相关制度体系创新，实现的基本途径是节能减排和发展清洁能源。"},{"cells":[],"group":"G36","group_id":"block:block-p0092-0007","image_path":"/Users/choney/Desktop/ESG  Database/ESG_DATA_PLATFORM/ExtractESG/document_ir_extract/document_ir_output/ir-20261006T195007Z-2a5862660c87/artifacts/page-images/page-0092.png","label":"","locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":51.49568858471339,"x1":98.99171203663352,"y0":345.8697003957907,"y1":358.36499304014734},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0007","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"page":91,"support_segments":[{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":51.49568858471339,"x1":98.99171203663352,"y0":345.8697003957907,"y1":358.36499304014734},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0007","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-1ebf951991a6a391ed884618","text":"储量接替率"}],"text":"储量接替率"},{"cells":[],"group":"G48","group_id":"block:block-p0092-0019","image_path":"/Users/choney/Desktop/ESG  Database/ESG_DATA_PLATFORM/ExtractESG/document_ir_extract/document_ir_output/ir-20261006T195007Z-2a5862660c87/artifacts/page-images/page-0092.png","label":"","locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":164.98618672772253,"x1":527.9557975287121,"y0":652.7540877411889,"y1":720.2286680207145},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0019","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"page":91,"support_segments":[{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":164.98618672772253,"x1":527.9557975287121,"y0":652.7540877411889,"y1":720.2286680207145},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0019","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-25db2b0612979e5aa379d05e","text":"二氧化碳（ $ CO_{2} $）、甲烷（ $ CH_{4} $）、氧化亚氮（ $ N_{2}O $）、氢氟碳化物（ $ HFC_{5} $）、全氟化碳（ $ PFC_{5} $）、六氟化硫（ $ SF_{6} $），是地球大气中主要的温室气体。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":164.98618672772253,"x1":527.9557975287121,"y0":652.7540877411889,"y1":720.2286680207145},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0019","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-4ef759e8bb5727b83dad7b5b","text":"这种温室气体使地球变得更温暖的影响称为“温室效应”。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":164.98618672772253,"x1":527.9557975287121,"y0":652.7540877411889,"y1":720.2286680207145},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0019","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-70e3a650d133e20e0d6f0a45","text":"指的是大气中能吸收地面反射的太阳辐射并重新发射辐射的一些气体，如水蒸气、二氧化碳、大部分制冷剂等。它们的作用是使地球表面变得更暖，类似于温室截留太阳辐射，并加热温室内空气的作用。这种温室气体使地球变得更温暖的影响称为“温室效应”。二氧化碳（ $ CO_{2} $）、甲烷（ $ CH_{4} $）、氧化亚氮（ $ N_{2}O $）、氢氟碳化物（ $ HFC_{5} $）、全氟化碳（ $ PFC_{5} $）、六氟化硫（ $ SF_{6} $），是地球大气中主要的温室气体。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":164.98618672772253,"x1":527.9557975287121,"y0":652.7540877411889,"y1":720.2286680207145},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0019","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-7e2cfdc48d05b005cbbf936e","text":"指的是大气中能吸收地面反射的太阳辐射并重新发射辐射的一些气体，如水蒸气、二氧化碳、大部分制冷剂等。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":164.98618672772253,"x1":527.9557975287121,"y0":652.7540877411889,"y1":720.2286680207145},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0019","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-8144a483394b7215d249b8bc","text":"它们的作用是使地球表面变得更暖，类似于温室截留太阳辐射，并加热温室内空气的作用。"}],"text":"指的是大气中能吸收地面反射的太阳辐射并重新发射辐射的一些气体，如水蒸气、二氧化碳、大部分制冷剂等。它们的作用是使地球表面变得更暖，类似于温室截留太阳辐射，并加热温室内空气的作用。这种温室气体使地球变得更温暖的影响称为“温室效应”。二氧化碳（ $ CO_{2} $）、甲烷（ $ CH_{4} $）、氧化亚氮（ $ N_{2}O $）、氢氟碳化物（ $ HFC_{5} $）、全氟化碳（ $ PFC_{5} $）、六氟化硫（ $ SF_{6} $），是地球大气中主要的温室气体。"},{"cells":[{"candidate_id":"cand-b0d70dce1765ef0966900710","cell_id":"cand-b0d70dce1765ef0966900710","char_end":72,"char_start":69,"column":"T222","column_headers":[],"grid_reliable":true,"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":94.99204690384023,"x1":524.9560486791171,"y0":183.43089601915491,"y1":235.41131341967835},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0005","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"raw":"20%","section_headers":[],"source_kind":"narrative","span_id":"span-2aa6669f866aa979c3e2985d","target_cell":"T222","unit":"%","value_forms":["20%","20"]}],"group":"G34","group_id":"block:block-p0092-0005","image_path":"/Users/choney/Desktop/ESG  Database/ESG_DATA_PLATFORM/ExtractESG/document_ir_extract/document_ir_output/ir-20261006T195007Z-2a5862660c87/artifacts/page-images/page-0092.png","label":"","locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":94.99204690384023,"x1":524.9560486791171,"y0":183.43089601915491,"y1":235.41131341967835},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0005","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"page":91,"support_segments":[{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":94.99204690384023,"x1":524.9560486791171,"y0":183.43089601915491,"y1":235.41131341967835},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0005","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-2aa6669f866aa979c3e2985d","text":"按中国国家标准，是指在油气藏评价阶段，经评价钻探证实油气藏（田）可提供开采并能获得经济效益后估算求得的、确定性很大的储量，相对误差不超过±20%。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":94.99204690384023,"x1":524.9560486791171,"y0":183.43089601915491,"y1":235.41131341967835},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0005","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-33664eb8a49b847289a120df","text":"探明储量包括探明地质储量、探明技术可采储量、探明经济可采储量（按开发状态又可分为探明已开发经济可采储量、探明未开发经济可采储量和探明已开发剩余经济可采储量）和探明次经济可采储量。"},{"locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":94.99204690384023,"x1":524.9560486791171,"y0":183.43089601915491,"y1":235.41131341967835},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0005","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_page_label":"6"}],"span_id":"span-bfe72911d8a79b195e301cfa","text":"按中国国家标准，是指在油气藏评价阶段，经评价钻探证实油气藏（田）可提供开采并能获得经济效益后估算求得的、确定性很大的储量，相对误差不超过±20%。探明储量包括探明地质储量、探明技术可采储量、探明经济可采储量（按开发状态又可分为探明已开发经济可采储量、探明未开发经济可采储量和探明已开发剩余经济可采储量）和探明次经济可采储量。"}],"text":"按中国国家标准，是指在油气藏评价阶段，经评价钻探证实油气藏（田）可提供开采并能获得经济效益后估算求得的、确定性很大的储量，相对误差不超过±20%。探明储量包括探明地质储量、探明技术可采储量、探明经济可采储量（按开发状态又可分为探明已开发经济可采储量、探明未开发经济可采储量和探明已开发剩余经济可采储量）和探明次经济可采储量。","unit":"%"},{"cells":[],"group":"G43","group_id":"block:block-p0092-0014","image_path":"/Users/choney/Desktop/ESG  Database/ESG_DATA_PLATFORM/ExtractESG/document_ir_extract/document_ir_output/ir-20261006T195007Z-2a5862660c87/artifacts/page-images/page-0092.png","label":"","locators":[{"bbox":{"coordinate_system_id":"page-0092-pdf-points","origin":"top_left","unit":"points","x0":51.49568858471339,"x1":81.49317708066295,"y0":539.296830530431,"y1":551.2923114690133},"ir_object_id":"block-p0092-0014","ir_object_type":"block","pdf_page_index":91,"printed_pag